        <activityName xml:lang="en">Printed board assembly, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Printed board assembly, at plant
This data is based on confidential data from a company. Data relates to 1 m2 surface printed board. It doesn't depend on the number of layers of the printed wiring board.;
UUID: 8f0a184e-5b04-37d1-ae54-903876f2a9b1
This data describes the requirements for the assembly of printed wiring boards. It includes the screenprinter, chipshooter, and reflow oven.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Fabrication of multilayer printed wiring board
Time period: Period of company data.
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_8f0a184e-5b04-37d1-ae54-903876f2a9b1.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
